> combineAlleles=FALSE, verbose=verbose,plm="RmaCnPlm");

FYI, you can also use the form (AS = allele specific):

dsList <- doASCRMAv2(name, chipType=chipType, verbose=verbose, plm="RmaCnPlm");

with identical results as the above.

>        cesNList[[chipType]] <- dsList$total;
> }
> glad <- GladModel(cesNList)
