Subject: Re: [aroma.affymetrix] CRMA v2 step 3 probe summarization
Message-ID: <mgLXZbHMWqc.sC7faaS0VfQJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <mgLXZbHMWqc.y3PcU_MllcgJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
