> On Wed, Nov 30, 2011 at 12:24 AM, Peiyong <jiangp...@cuhk.edu.hk> wrote:
>> Thanks!
>>
>> directory structure:
>> /A/B/C/
>> |-- annotationData
>> |   `-- chipTypes
>> |       `-- GenomeWideSNP_6
